fn.p:
(i) we have replaced claims of absence with “not detected” throughout;
(ii) we have added a paragraph describing the discrepancies between methods and the specific false-negative risks of each; and
(iii) we have made explicit the internal positive controls that constrain our negative results, including the reciprocal GluRIIB/GluRIIC labeling within a single femur and the detection of Brp, Neto-β, and GluClα in the same flight muscle preparations in which GluRII subunits were not detected.
